42900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1450"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="800"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>3. Verify &amp; Decide: Critic Agent validates portion &amp; macro sanity; 7 signals fused into calibrated confidence; if confidence &lt; τ, triggers targeted clarification (max 2 rounds).</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1450"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="800"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>4. Present &amp; Deliver: Report Agent explains validated facts; Diet Agent provides goal guidance; persists full execution metadata in SQLite &amp; Chroma.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="342900" indent="-342900"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1450"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="800"/></a:spcAft><a:buSzPct val="100000"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222222"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>Feedback Loop: User clarification answers loop back to re-run portion &amp; nutrition for affected components; skipped questions report with stated bounds.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2400" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="Times New Roman" pitchFamily="18" charset="0"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:c